 *     `Server-side`. This is Thunderstore's loose analogue of Modrinth's
/**
 * Bulk-import the real uMod (Oxide/Carbon) Rust plugin catalogue into
 * `GameMod` — closes the gap the 2026-09-24 audit found: `rust` has only 29
 * hand-seeded uMod rows today while uMod's own public JSON API exposes
 * ~1,419 real Rust plugins. `scripts/verify-gamemods.ts` currently believes
 * uMod has no public API at all (its file header says so) — it does; this
 * script is the real one.
 *
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * ToS STATUS — READ BEFORE RUNNING WITH --apply (unresolved as of 2026-09-24)
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * uMod's own Terms of Service page and robots.txt are BOTH behind a
 * Cloudflare bot challenge (confirmed live: `curl https://umod.org/robots.txt`
 * and `curl https://umod.org/plugins` both return HTTP 403 "Just a moment...",
 * a JS challenge page, not real content) — this script's author could not
 * actually read uMod's terms before writing this, and could not confirm
 * whether bulk metadata import is permitted. Given that, this script is
 * DELIBERATELY SCOPED to metadata only:
