 * SOURCE: `https://umod.org/plugins/search.json?page=N` — real, keyless,
 * paginated JSON (confirmed live: 1,710 total items across 171 pages of 10;
 * no working per_page/limit override was found, all attempted filter
 * params — game/games[]/category/q — were silently ignored, so this script
