 * verified live: sampling pages 1/20/50/90/130/171 found 55/60 items tagged
 * "rust" in `games_detail`, matching the audit's ~1,419-of-1,710 estimate).
 *
 * RATE LIMIT: the 2026-09-24 audit noted ~30/min seen against this API;
 * this script paces itself under that by default (RATE_LIMIT_PER_MIN).
 *
 * IDENTITY: uMod's own `slug` (e.g. "3d-teleporter") is globally unique and
 * IS what this repo's 29 existing hand-seeded uMod rows already use as both
 * `slug` and `sourceId` (confirmed live against the real API: all 4 sampled
 * hand-seeded slugs — admin-radar, vanish, player-administration, economics
 * — resolve on umod.org) — this script reuses it directly rather than
 * inventing a second slug scheme, so re-running it upserts onto the exact
 * same 29 rows rather than duplicating them.
 *
 * IDEMPOTENT: `db.gameMod.upsert` on `@@unique([gameFamily, slug])`, same
 * contract as every other importer in this repo.
 *
 *   Dry run (no writes), tiny slice:
 *     NXEON_DB_TARGET=nxeon_staging npx tsx scripts/import-umod-catalog.ts --max-pages=5
